And right next to that one is the Thanksgiving family game night.

142
00:10:18,224 --> 00:10:22,532
It has a whole set of mini games with the rules and a way that we can keep score.

143
00:10:22,702 --> 00:10:24,384
And it's everything that we asked for.

144
00:10:24,544 --> 00:10:27,268
So with that being said, we have built our first agent.

